<title>UK: World Bank adds 150 mln rand to one-yr zero coupon.</title>
<headline>World Bank adds 150 mln rand to one-yr zero coupon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 300 million rand from 150 million rand, lead manager Hambros Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *150 MLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    22.MAY.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  87.60     PAY DATE    22.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/GB/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  0.10</p>
<p> NOTES     *ADD-ON TO 150 MLN RAND DEAL LAUNCHED 24.APR AT 87.58</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
